---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";

const items = [
  { label: "Licenses in all 50 states", status: "Active" },
  { label: "A-rated carrier paper", status: "AM Best A+" },
  { label: "Program capital & reinsurance", status: "Committed" },
  { label: "State filings & rate management", status: "Filed" },
  { label: "Producer appointments", status: "Managed" },
  { label: "Claims TPA & compliance monitoring", status: "Live" },
];
---

<section id="solutions" class="relative py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="container-page grid items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
    <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 lg:col-span-7">
      <div class="reveal-init relative">
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-x-6 -inset-y-8 -z-10 rounded-[40px] bg-cyan-pulse/[0.06] blur-2xl"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>

        <div class="card-frame overflow-hidden bg-deep-kelp/40">
          <div
            class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-pale-foam/10 px-6 py-4 md:px-7"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <Icon name="shield" size={17} class="text-lime-voltage" />
              <span class="text-body-sm font-medium text-bone">
                Program checklist
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-caption uppercase tracking-[0.35px] text-storm-glass">
              6 of 6
            </span>
          </div>

          <ul class="divide-y divide-pale-foam/10">
            {
              items.map((item) => (
                <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4 md:px-7">
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-3 text-body-sm text-pale-foam">
                    <span class="grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-lime-voltage/12 text-lime-voltage">
                      <Icon name="check" size={12} strokeWidth={2.2} />
                    </span>
                    {item.label}
                  </span>
                  <span class="shrink-0 text-caption uppercase tracking-[0.35px] text-storm-glass">
                    {item.status}
                  </span>
                </li>
              ))
            }
          </ul>

          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-pale-foam/10 bg-abyss-teal/40 px-6 py-3.5 text-caption text-storm-glass md:px-7"
          >
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-lime-voltage"></span>
            Nothing left to paper over
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 lg:col-span-5">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal-init">Solutions</p>
      <h2
        class="reveal-init mt-5 max-w-[15ch] text-[clamp(34px,5vw,54px)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.035em]"
        style="--reveal-delay: 80ms"
      >
        Licensing, capital, and carriers —{" "}
        <span class="accent-underline">handled.</span>
      </h2>
      <p
        class="reveal-init mt-6 max-w-[44ch] text-subheading font-light text-sea-mist"
        style="--reveal-delay: 140ms"
      >
        The unglamorous 90% of insurance is our job. You bring distribution and a
        product idea; we bring the paper, the balance sheet, and the regulators.
      </p>

      <div
        class="reveal-init mt-9 grid gap-5 border-t border-pale-foam/10 pt-8 sm:grid-cols-2"
        style="--reveal-delay: 200ms"
      >
        <div>
          <p class="text-heading font-light text-bone">1 contract</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-body-sm text-storm-glass">
            Instead of 40 carrier and vendor agreements.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-heading font-light text-bone">0 licenses</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-body-sm text-storm-glass">
            Required of you. We hold them, you use them.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
